OL,3,GNEWSAKew Gardens asks public for #1m
OL,4,Afor Palm House
OL,5,
OL,6,FSo far, about half the funds have been
OL,7,Fsecured from philanthropists, grants
OL,8,Fand individuals. The gardens now hope
OL,9,Fto raise a further #1m from the public.
